.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH SYNC 1 "2026-09-01"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sync \- Synchronize cached writes to persistent storage
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBsync\fR [OPTION]... FILE...
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Synchronize cached writes to persistent storage
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-file\-system\fR
sync the file systems that contain the files (Linux and Windows only)
.TP
\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-data\fR
sync only file data, no unneeded metadata (Linux only)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
[\fIfiles\fR]

.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
v(uutils coreutils) 0.11.0
